#: controllers/pages/destinations.php:29
#: controllers/pages/_backup-perform.php:174
#: controllers/pages/_backup-perform.php:356 views/migrate-home.php:273
#: views/multisite_export.php:67 views/_backup-home.php:423
#: views/_backup-widget.php:244
msgid "You will be notified by email if any problems are encountered."
msgstr "E-mailben értesítünk, ha probléma merül fel."

